      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea that you have nothing left to give is a very heavy, but very persuasive, thought when you are in this much pain. If you are feeling like the only relief is to stop, that is a sign of a deep, urgent need for immediate, real-world help. Please reach out to a crisis line right now; they are trained to listen without judgment to exactly these kinds of thoughts. You do not have to carry this feeling of finality alone.",
      "source": "target",
